<title>POLAND: Krosno plans no dividend for 1996.</title>
<headline>Krosno plans no dividend for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish glass maker Krosno SA plans to pay no dividend for 1996, putting 9.8 million of its 10.1-million-zloty net profit into reserve capital, the firm said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The rest would go to supervisory board members and to a social fund for employees.</p>
<p>Shareholders will vote on the proposal on June 25.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
